---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Intro from "../components/Intro.astro";
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer">
  <Intro
    eyebrow="CONTEXT & LIMITATIONS"
    title="An informed starting point."
    description="Information on this website supports an initial conversation. Review the original JEA disclaimer and the context for the asset library and toolkit."
  />
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>JEA’s disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The existing JEA BizDev Consulting disclaimer is available in its
        original format.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/Disclaimer.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        Read the disclaimer (PDF)
      </a>
      <h2>Asset information</h2>
      <p>
        Asset descriptions preserve information from existing JEA materials,
        including historical development plans and sponsor-reported scientific
        data. Current development status, supporting data, rights, and
        availability should be confirmed directly with JEA.
      </p>
      <h2>Transaction information</h2>
      <p>
        Transaction announcements and deal summaries are historical reference
        materials. Headline transaction values may include contingent milestones
        and do not necessarily represent consideration already received.
      </p>
      <h2>Interactive tools</h2>
      <p>
        The calculators show arithmetic based on your inputs and stated
        assumptions. They do not provide asset valuations, clinical forecasts,
        investment recommendations, legal advice, or quotes for JEA services.
        Example values are illustrative. Review the formula and limitations on
        each tool page.
      </p>
      <h2>Starting an engagement</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting an inquiry starts a conversation. Scope, fees, deliverables,
        and other engagement terms are agreed separately.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
